483	    /**
484	     * Builds the member id {@code '<REGION><FY><HASH8><CHK>'}: the version-2 region code (the
485	     * postcode-derived region prefixed with the {@link IdentityVersion#TAG version tag}), the
486	     * two-digit fiscal year derived from the (business-day-adjusted) registrationDate, the first
487	     * eight upper-case hexadecimal characters of the SHA-256 digest over the version tag concatenated
488	     * with the owner's normalized (E.164) telephone and the last name, and a single Luhn check digit
489	     * computed over the digits of {@code <REGION><FY><HASH8>}. No sequence number is used; the
490	     * identity is fully derived from the region, fiscal year and hash. Mixing the version tag into
491	     * both the region prefix and the hash ensures no value produced under version 1 is produced again.
492	     */
